    <bpmn:process id="W_W4001" name="W4001. Human Rights &amp; Responsible Sourcing Policy, Commitments &amp; Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program stand-up; annual review; regulatory change
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Enterprise program (5 entities, ~800–1,000 vendors)
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Legal
Participants: Sustainability (links to VS-25), Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34/VS-122), Legal (links to VS-100), HR (links to VS-19/VS-103), Compliance (links to VS-119), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Board (links to VS-36), Global Sourcing (links to VS-122)
Source: workflow W4001 — Human Rights &amp; Responsible Sourcing Policy, Commitments &amp; Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4001_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4001_Lane1" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4001_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4001_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4001_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4001_Lane2" name="CEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4001_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4001_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4001_Start4" name="Program stand-up; annual review; regulatory change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4001_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4001_Task5" name="Sustainability/ESG Manager/VP Legal &amp; Compliance define the human-rights &amp;…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability/ESG Manager/VP Legal &amp; Compliance define the human-rights &amp; responsible-sourcing policy aligned to the UN Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights (UNGPs), ILO core conventions, the UN Global Compact, and Philippine labor law (links to VS-84/VS-19); cover own operations and the full supply chain; set commitments (zero forced/child labor, living-wage direction, freedom of association, responsible recruitment, no land-rights harm)
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Sustainability
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4001_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4001_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4001_Task6" name="Sustainability/ESG Manager establish governance: a cross-functional…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sustainability/ESG Manager establish governance: a cross-functional responsible-sourcing steering (Procurement, Merchandising, Legal, HR, Compliance, Global Sourcing), decision rights, the integration with vendor management (VS-03), ESG (VS-25), ethics/speak-up (VS-119), and audit (VS-21), and KPIs
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager / Procurement / Legal
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4001_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4001_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4001_Task7" name="CEO/Board ratify the policy, approve the budget/resources, and cascade as a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CEO/Board ratify the policy, approve the budget/resources, and cascade as a board-level enterprise risk (links to VS-21.2 ERM and VS-36 governance); publish externally and to suppliers
Responsible (R): CEO / Board
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4001_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4001_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4001_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4001_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-73 (ensure human-rights supply-chain due diligence.) | - operational: dedicated program; operational: HRDD framework (W4003)
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Legal</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4001_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4001_Annotation9" targetRef="W4001_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4001_Flow11" sourceRef="W4001_Start4" targetRef="W4001_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4001_Flow12" sourceRef="W4001_Task5" targetRef="W4001_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4001_Flow13" sourceRef="W4001_Task6" targetRef="W4001_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4001_Flow14" sourceRef="W4001_Task7" targetRef="W4001_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4001_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4001_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4001">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4001_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4001_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4001_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W4001_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4001_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W4001_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4001_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W4001_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4001_Task7_di" bpmnElement="W4001_Task7"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
