    <bpmn:process id="W_W4002" name="W4002. Salient Human Rights Risk Identification &amp; Materiality Assessment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual; new category/geography; major event
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: ~13 categories × sourcing geographies
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager
Participants: Sustainability, Procurement/Global Sourcing (links to VS-122/VS-03), Insights (links to VS-44), Legal, HR, external human-rights advisors, stakeholders
Source: workflow W4002 — Salient Human Rights Risk Identification &amp; Materiality Assessment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4002_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4002_Lane1" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4002_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4002_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4002_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4002_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4002_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4002_Start3" name="Annual; new category/geography; major event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4002_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4002_Task4" name="Sustainability/Procurement identify salient human-rights risks across…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability/Procurement identify salient human-rights risks across BuildRight&#x27;s operations and supply chain using the UNGP saliency lens (scale, scope, irremediability): forced/modern-slavery labor, child labor, unsafe conditions, wage/hour violations, discrimination, freedom-of-association limits, migrant-labor abuse, and community/land-rights impacts — mapped by category (tools/electronics, paint/chemicals, lumber, tiles, PPE, garden/agro) and sourcing geography
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Procurement / Global Sourcing
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4002_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4002_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4002_Task5" name="Sustainability prioritize salient risks and the supply-chain…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sustainability prioritize salient risks and the supply-chain tiers/geographies/categories where they concentrate (tier-1 vendors, tier-2 component/material suppliers, raw-material origin), and integrate findings into ESG materiality (links to VS-25.2) and the ERM risk register (links to VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Insights / Legal
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4002_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4002_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4002_Task6" name="Sustainability document the saliency assessment, retain evidence, and feed it…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability document the saliency assessment, retain evidence, and feed it into the HRDD framework (W4003), risk modeling (W4006), and reporting (links to PA-131.3)
Responsible (R): Sustainability
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4002_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4002_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4002_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4002_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-73 (ensure human-rights supply-chain due diligence.) | - operational: UNGP lens and geography/category mapping; operational: annual cycle and event triggers
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4002_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4002_Annotation8" targetRef="W4002_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4002_Flow10" sourceRef="W4002_Start3" targetRef="W4002_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4002_Flow11" sourceRef="W4002_Task4" targetRef="W4002_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4002_Flow12" sourceRef="W4002_Task5" targetRef="W4002_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4002_Flow13" sourceRef="W4002_Task6" targetRef="W4002_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4002_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4002_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4002">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4002_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4002_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4002_Task4_di" bpmnElement="W4002_Task4"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4002_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W4002_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4002_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W4002_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4002_Start3_di" bpmnElement="W4002_Start3"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4002_End7_di" bpmnElement="W4002_End7"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4002_Annotation8_di" bpmnElement="W4002_Annotation8"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="290" width="360" height="60" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4002_Flow10_di" bpmnElement="W4002_Flow10"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4002_Flow11_di" bpmnElement="W4002_Flow11"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4002_Flow12_di" bpmnElement="W4002_Flow12"><di:waypoint x="790" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4002_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W4002_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4002_Assoc9_di" bpmnElement="W4002_Assoc9"><di:waypoint x="340" y="290" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4003" name="W4003. Human Rights Due Diligence (HRDD) Framework &amp; Operating Model" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Policy (W4001); saliency (W4002)
Frequency: Maintained + continuous
Volume: Enterprise HRDD framework
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Supply Chain
Participants: Sustainability, Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34/VS-122), Legal, Compliance (links to VS-119), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), HR, affected business units
Source: workflow W4003 — Human Rights Due Diligence (HRDD) Framework &amp; Operating Model</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4003_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4003_Lane1" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4003_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4003_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4003_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4003_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4003_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4003_Start3" name="Policy (W4001); saliency (W4002)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4003_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4003_Task4" name="Sustainability/ESG Manager/Procurement establish the HRDD framework per UNGP…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability/ESG Manager/Procurement establish the HRDD framework per UNGP: identify and assess (W4009), act on impacts (prevent/mitigate/remediate — W4010–W4014), track effectiveness (W4019), and communicate (W4020/W4021); define risk-based intensity (enhanced DD for high-risk categories/geographies)
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager / Procurement / Sustainability
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Supply Chain
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4003_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4003_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4003_Task5" name="Sustainability/ESG Manager/Procurement embed HRDD into the procurement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sustainability/ESG Manager/Procurement embed HRDD into the procurement lifecycle: sourcing/onboarding gates (links to VS-03.1/VS-122.2), contract safeguards (W4005), PO and order allocation (links to VS-03.2), and supplier management (links to VS-67) — making human-rights DD a prerequisite to doing business
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4003_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4003_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4003_Task6" name="Sustainability/ESG Manager/Sustainability operate continuous HRDD: monitor risk…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability/ESG Manager/Sustainability operate continuous HRDD: monitor risk intelligence, refresh saliency (W4002), and coordinate remediation/grievance (W4012/W4013) and responsible disengagement (W4014)
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4003_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4003_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4003_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4003_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-623 (ensure controlled execution — Human Rights Policy, Salient-Risk Identification &amp; Due Diligence Framework (PA-131.1).) | - operational: gates and contract safeguards; operational: risk-based tiering
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Supply Chain</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4003_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4003_Annotation8" targetRef="W4003_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4003_Flow10" sourceRef="W4003_Start3" targetRef="W4003_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4003_Flow11" sourceRef="W4003_Task4" targetRef="W4003_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4003_Flow12" sourceRef="W4003_Task5" targetRef="W4003_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4003_Flow13" sourceRef="W4003_Task6" targetRef="W4003_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4003_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4003_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4003">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4003_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4003_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4003_Task4_di" bpmnElement="W4003_Task4"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4003_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W4003_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4003_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W4003_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4003_Start3_di" bpmnElement="W4003_Start3"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4003_End7_di" bpmnElement="W4003_End7"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4003_Annotation8_di" bpmnElement="W4003_Annotation8"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="290" width="360" height="72" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4003_Flow10_di" bpmnElement="W4003_Flow10"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4003_Flow11_di" bpmnElement="W4003_Flow11"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4003_Flow12_di" bpmnElement="W4003_Flow12"><di:waypoint x="790" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4003_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W4003_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4003_Assoc9_di" bpmnElement="W4003_Assoc9"><di:waypoint x="340" y="290" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4004" name="W4004. Supply Chain Mapping, Transparency &amp; Traceability Program" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: HRDD framework; traceability need; B2B customer/regulatory requirement
Frequency: Continuous + periodic refresh
Volume: ~800–1,000 tier-1 vendors; selected tier-2/N
Owner: VP Supply Chain / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Participants: Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-122), Global Sourcing (links to VS-122), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Master Data (links to VS-29), Sustainability, IT (links to VS-27/VS-113)
Source: workflow W4004 — Supply Chain Mapping, Transparency &amp; Traceability Program</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4004_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4004_Lane1" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4004_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4004_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4004_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4004_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4004_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4004_Start3" name="HRDD framework; traceability need; B2B customer/regulatory requirement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4004_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4004_Task4" name="Procurement/Global-Sourcing map the supply chain: tier-1 vendors, key tier-2…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Procurement/Global-Sourcing map the supply chain: tier-1 vendors, key tier-2 (component/material) suppliers, and raw-material origins (minerals, timber, latex, cotton, palm) for salient categories — capturing geography, factory/site, and certifications
Responsible (R): Procurement / Global Sourcing / Sustainability
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Continuous + periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4004_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4004_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4004_Task5" name="Procurement/IT build transparency/traceability: supplier disclosure (factories…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Procurement/IT build transparency/traceability: supplier disclosure (factories, subcontracting), tier-2 mapping for high-risk categories, product-origin/attributes in the item master (links to VS-29), and (where warranted) traceability technology — distinct from anti-counterfeit serialization (VS-71)
Responsible (R): Procurement / IT / MDM / Sustainability
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4004_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4004_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4004_Task6" name="Procurement/Sustainability maintain the map, refresh on sourcing change…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Procurement/Sustainability maintain the map, refresh on sourcing change, identify transparency gaps and blind spots, and feed risk modeling (W4006) and reporting (W4020)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Sustainability
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4004_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4004_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4004_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
