    <bpmn:process id="W_W4005" name="W4005. Supplier Code of Conduct, Onboarding &amp; Contractual Safeguards" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor onboarding (links to VS-03.1); contract renewal
Frequency: Per vendor + maintained code
Volume: ~800–1,000 vendors
Owner: VP Supply Chain / VP Legal
Participants: Procurement (links to VS-03), Legal (links to VS-100), Compliance (links to VS-119), Sustainability, Global Sourcing (links to VS-122)
Source: workflow W4005 — Supplier Code of Conduct, Onboarding &amp; Contractual Safeguards</bpmn:documentation>
