        <bpmn:outgoing>W4005_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4005_Task5" name="Sustainability/ESG Manager/Legal maintain the Supplier Code of Conduct (labor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability/ESG Manager/Legal maintain the Supplier Code of Conduct (labor standards, no forced/child labor, wage/hour, health &amp; safety, freedom of association, non-discrimination, responsible recruitment, environmental, anti-bribery links to VS-86, sub-tier disclosure, and the right to audit) aligned to BuildRight&#x27;s own commitments (W4001)
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager / Legal / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain / VP Legal
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4005_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4005_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4005_Task6" name="Procurement/Legal require code acknowledgment and contractual safeguards on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Procurement/Legal require code acknowledgment and contractual safeguards on onboarding (links to VS-03.1/VS-122.2) and renewal: flow-down to sub-tiers, audit/inspection rights, remediation obligations, termination for breach, and data/transparency obligations
Responsible (R): Procurement / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4005_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4005_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4005_Task7" name="Procurement track acknowledgment/adherence, integrate with vendor scorecard…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Procurement track acknowledgment/adherence, integrate with vendor scorecard (links to VS-67), and enforce consequences for non-compliance (links to W4014)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Sustainability
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4005_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4005_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4005_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
