    <bpmn:process id="W_W4006" name="W4006. Modern Slavery, Forced Labor &amp; Child Labor Risk Modeling" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: HRDD framework; supply-chain mapping (W4004); new category/geography
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: All vendors/sourcing geographies
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Supply Chain
Participants: Sustainability, Procurement/Global Sourcing (links to VS-03/VS-122), Insights (links to VS-44), external risk-intelligence/data providers, Legal
Source: workflow W4006 — Modern Slavery, Forced Labor &amp; Child Labor Risk Modeling</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4006_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4006_Lane1" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4006_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4006_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4006_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4006_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4006_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4006_Start3" name="HRDD framework; supply-chain mapping (W4004); new category/geography">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4006_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4006_Task4" name="Sustainability/Procurement model modern-slavery/forced-labor/child-labor risk…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability/Procurement model modern-slavery/forced-labor/child-labor risk per vendor, category, and geography using indices (e.g., Global Slavery Index), sector risk (tools/electronics, PPE/apparel, lumber, garden/agro, minerals), and intelligence (media, NGO, sanctions links to VS-86, import-detention data)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Procurement / Insights
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4006_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4006_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4006_Task5" name="Sustainability/Procurement tier vendors into risk bands (low/enhanced/high)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sustainability/Procurement tier vendors into risk bands (low/enhanced/high), flag high-risk vendors/categories/geographies for enhanced DD (links to W4009), and prioritize audits (W4010) and traceability (W4004)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Procurement
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Supply Chain
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4006_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4006_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4006_Task6" name="Sustainability refresh the model on change, monitor for emerging risks (new…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability refresh the model on change, monitor for emerging risks (new evidence, regulatory watchlists), and feed findings into sourcing decisions (links to W4014/W4009) and reporting (W4020)
Responsible (R): Sustainability
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4006_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4006_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4006_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
