        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-73 (ensure human-rights supply-chain due diligence.) | - operational: multi-source indices and intelligence; operational: annual cycle and event triggers
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Supply Chain</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
