    <bpmn:process id="W_W4007" name="W4007. Responsible Recruitment, Migrant Labor &amp; Recruitment-Fee Controls" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Saliency (W4002); high-risk vendor/geography
Frequency: Maintained + on finding
Volume: Vendors employing migrant/contract labor
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Supply Chain
Participants: Sustainability, Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-122), Legal, HR (links to VS-19), Compliance (links to VS-119), external auditors
Source: workflow W4007 — Responsible Recruitment, Migrant Labor &amp; Recruitment-Fee Controls</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4007_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4007_Lane1" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4007_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4007_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4007_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4007_Lane2" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4007_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4007_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4007_Start4" name="Saliency (W4002); high-risk vendor/geography">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4007_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4007_Task5" name="Sustainability/Procurement assess responsible-recruitment risk: migrant-labor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability/Procurement assess responsible-recruitment risk: migrant-labor prevalence in sourcing geographies (factory/field), recruitment-fee/debt-bondage exposure, document-retention and movement-restriction indicators, and the &quot;Employer Pays&quot; principle (no worker fees for employment)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Procurement
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Maintained + on finding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4007_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4007_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4007_Task6" name="Procurement/Legal embed responsible-recruitment contractual safeguards (no…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Procurement/Legal embed responsible-recruitment contractual safeguards (no worker-paid recruitment fees, document retention by worker, no movement restriction) and require evidence from high-risk vendors; coordinate with BuildRight&#x27;s own contingent-workforce practices (links to VS-98)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Legal / HR
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per high-risk vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4007_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4007_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4007_Task7" name="Sustainability verify via audit (links to W4010/W4011), remediate where fees…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability verify via audit (links to W4010/W4011), remediate where fees paid (reimbursement), and report (W4020); engage stakeholders (W4021)
Responsible (R): Sustainability
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: On finding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4007_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4007_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4007_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4007_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-73 (ensure human-rights supply-chain due diligence.) | - operational: audit and worker voice; operational: remediation tracking (W4012)
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Supply Chain</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4007_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4007_Annotation9" targetRef="W4007_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
